  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "On the Imperial Court contest field, Mo Shi Kuang shouts World Devouring Qi as his killer move. Gao Yang feels danger and tries to flee, but the surrounding air is as dense as walls and he can barely move. Mo Shi Kuang floats with his ten fingers gathered before his chest. Gao Yang and Zhu Zai feel pressure squashing them from all directions. Before death, Zhu Zai bursts the strength of three grand emperor boar, pierces a hole in the wall-like air, and tosses Gao Yang clear of the battlefield. Zhu Zai is squeezed into meat paste by intense concentrated air pressure. Mo Shi Kuang vomits blood. Ouyang Bi Sang holds him and says the killer move is not completed yet and not to activate it casually. Mo Shi Kuang laughs that he used it without thinking.",
      "chapters": [
        533
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
