    },
    {
      "text": "When Liu Wen Wu, Ouyang Bi Sang, and Mo Shi Kuang fight as Three Head Six Arms, six clawed hands slash World Devouring Qi at Hei Lou Lan’s dark vortex. Air becomes as thick as a wall and as solid as a mountain, so Hei Lou Lan cannot keep pressing forward. Air from all around surges and swallows the black sphere. The killer move Mo Shi Kuang could not finish alone is perfected in the monster’s hand.",
